config BQ2597X_CHARGE_PUMP
	bool "TI BQ2597x / SC8551 charge pump (Xiaomi)"
	depends on I2C && OF
	help
	  Div-2 switched-capacitor charge pump used for PD/QC3 fast charging
	  on Xiaomi sdmmagpie phones (sweet, toco, tucana). This port only
	  binds the chip, programs its protections and ADC and keeps the
	  switcher off; the PD policy manager that drives it is separate.
